<title>FINLAND: FINLAND'S POST AND TELE SUOMEN PT 1996 PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>FINLAND'S POST AND TELE SUOMEN PT 1996 PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to end-Dec, 1996</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Net sales					 11,522 vs 10,558</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation     3,238 vs 2,745</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	  1,450 vs 1,282</p>
<p> Total assets				    11,669 vs 11,122</p>
<p> Return on investment (ROI)(percent)	 16.8 vs 16.5</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		76 vs 73</p>
<p> Gross investment				 3,416 vs 2,437</p>
<p> Personnel at end-year			 32,721 vs 34,480</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish state-owned holding company is</p>
<p>Suomen PT, incorporating Suomen Posti Oy and telecoms operator</p>
<p>Telecom Finland.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
</text>
